158
00:13:50,016 --> 00:13:55,516
やばい、やばい！ ゴール！
Oh no, oh no! Goal!

159
00:13:55,516 --> 00:14:00,016
行け！ トワ様！ 行け、行け！
Go, Towa-sama! Go, go!

160
00:14:00,016 --> 00:14:05,016
イェーイ！ おめでとうございます！
Yeah! Congratulations!

161
00:14:05,016 --> 00:14:09,016
Congratulations! I'm a winner!

162
00:14:09,016 --> 00:14:14,016
Well, technically it wasn't just a battle between them...

163
00:14:14,016 --> 00:14:18,016
一応タイムアタックなんで、後で…
It's technically a time attack, so later...

164
00:14:18,016 --> 00:14:27,016
森カリオペ：ラップだけじゃない！華麗なライディングにも期待！
[Mori Calliope: More Than Just Rap! Expect a Stylish Ride!] "I feel I'm really well prepared for this race. You know, I'm a 4-time champ of Underworld University Tricycle Marathon..."

165
00:14:27,016 --> 00:14:34,016
一伊那爾栖：WAHパワー全開！？意外なスピードに期待！
[Ninomae Ina'nis: WAH Power?! Unexpected Speed!] "Win or lose, I get to eat Bae's cookie. Yeah."

166
00:14:34,016 --> 00:14:40,016
All righty! Seems like Calli and Ina are all set. Are you two feeling confident?

167
00:14:40,016 --> 00:14:45,016
Oh! ごめんごめん、ちっちゃいね、イナちゃん！
Oh! Sorry, sorry, Ina-chan is so small!

168
00:14:45,016 --> 00:14:50,016
ちっちゃい！ Yeah, Ina and Calli, we'd never fight.
So small! Yeah, Ina and Calli, we'd never fight.

169
00:14:50,016 --> 00:14:54,016
You guys ready? Can we get a one comment from the both of you, please?

170
00:14:54,016 --> 00:14:58,516
私、勝つ！ 勝つ？ 勝つ？
Me win! Win? Win?

171
00:14:58,516 --> 00:15:00,141
It's not as funny...

172
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,824
カツさん！カツさん！
Katsu-san! Katsu-san!

173
00:15:02,824 --> 00:15:05,824
カツさんだ！カツさんだ！
It's Katsu-san! It's Katsu-san!

174
00:15:05,824 --> 00:15:08,524
ウィーンさんとカツさん！
Wien-san and Katsu-san!

175
00:15:08,524 --> 00:15:11,224
Ina is hungry~

176
00:15:11,224 --> 00:15:14,324
お腹空いた...
I'm hungry...

177
00:15:14,324 --> 00:15:17,024
カツを食べろ！カツを！
Eat katsu! Eat katsu!

178
00:15:17,024 --> 00:15:19,824
何カツさん言います？
What Katsu-san are you talking about?

179
00:15:19,824 --> 00:15:23,224
カツ丼？ カツ丼？ カツを...
Katsudon? Katsudon? Katsu...

180
00:15:23,224 --> 00:15:26,824
カツ丼
Katsudon.

181
00:15:27,224 --> 00:15:32,524
やばい、止めて！止めてってば！
Oh no, stop it! Stop it I said!

182
00:15:32,524 --> 00:15:35,024
準備OKですか？
Are you ready?

183
00:15:35,024 --> 00:15:38,824
Who's using the inner and who's using the outer?

184
00:15:38,824 --> 00:15:43,824
Outside is apparently stronger, so whoever wins gets outside.

185
00:15:44,024 --> 00:15:47,024
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

186
00:15:48,824 --> 00:15:51,524
Calliは外側！
Calli gets the outside!

187
00:15:51,524 --> 00:15:57,224
I get the feeling this position is best!

188
00:15:57,224 --> 00:16:00,824
I don't know, I got a bad feeling about this one...

189
00:16:00,824 --> 00:16:03,524
Alright, you guys ready?

190
00:16:03,524 --> 00:16:08,524
Alright, here we go! 3, 2, 1, go!

191
00:16:08,524 --> 00:16:13,524
いけー！ Let's go, Ina!
Go! Let's go, Ina!

192
00:16:13,524 --> 00:16:21,024
Out of my way!

193
00:16:21,024 --> 00:16:27,524
There will be no context for me!

194
00:16:27,524 --> 00:16:33,224
Ina, 頑張れ！
Do your best, Ina!

195
00:16:33,224 --> 00:16:38,524
No one's gonna get in front of me!

196
00:16:38,524 --> 00:16:45,524
Look at that!

197
00:16:52,524 --> 00:16:58,024
That's the first time I've exercised in two years...

198
00:16:58,024 --> 00:17:01,024
Ina, 大丈夫？
Ina, are you okay?

199
00:17:01,024 --> 00:17:04,524
I'm okay! I'm okay!

200
00:17:04,524 --> 00:17:09,024
Ina先輩...
Ina-senpai...

201
00:17:09,024 --> 00:17:14,024
Wow, with the four of them completing the race...

202
00:17:14,024 --> 00:17:20,024
...I think we should announce the times before I try.

203
00:17:20,024 --> 00:17:25,024
4人終わったんで、タイムを発表したいと思います！
Since all four have finished, I'd like to announce the times!

204
00:17:25,024 --> 00:17:28,024
じゃあ、最初はスバル先輩！
First up is Subaru-senpai!

205
00:17:28,024 --> 00:17:30,824
タイムは何でしょうーか？
What is her time?!

206
00:17:30,824 --> 00:17:33,824
28.85秒！
28.85 seconds!

207
00:17:33,824 --> 00:17:37,524
速っ！結構いいんじゃない？これ！
So fast! Isn't that pretty good?!

208
00:17:37,524 --> 00:17:42,524
速いっすね！ じゃあ、次はトワ様！
That's fast! Next up is Towa-sama!

209
00:17:42,524 --> 00:17:46,524
タイムは...
The time is...

210
00:17:46,524 --> 00:17:50,024
35.63秒！
35.63 seconds!

211
00:17:50,024 --> 00:17:55,024
結構... でも速いっすよ！
That's... but still pretty fast!

212
00:17:55,024 --> 00:18:00,024
次は Calliope Mori! Your time is...
Next is Calliope Mori! Your time is...

213
00:18:00,024 --> 00:18:03,024
36.72!

214
00:18:03,024 --> 00:18:08,024
I'm fast!

215
00:18:08,024 --> 00:18:12,524
えっ、速っ！
Wait, so fast!

216
00:18:12,524 --> 00:18:17,024
で、最後はイナ！ Your time is...
And lastly, Ina! Your time is...

217
00:18:17,024 --> 00:18:20,024
38.44!

218
00:18:20,024 --> 00:18:24,024
でもさ...
But still...

219
00:18:24,024 --> 00:18:27,824
え、でもみんな速くね？
Wait, isn't everyone fast?

220
00:18:27,824 --> 00:18:33,024
つまり、Bae-chan, maybe you're also a little slow like we are.
So, Bae-chan, maybe you're also a little slow like we are.

221
00:18:33,024 --> 00:18:36,524
40秒ぐらいでお願いしたいところか...
We'd like you to get around 40 seconds...

222
00:18:36,524 --> 00:18:41,524
So I have to beat... みんな食べれるタイムだったら...
So I have to beat... If it's a time where everyone gets to eat...

223
00:18:41,524 --> 00:18:48,024
28秒切れればいいってことだな！
You just need to beat 28 seconds!

224
00:18:48,024 --> 00:18:52,024
Be faster than 28 seconds.

225
00:18:52,024 --> 00:18:56,824
Well, with that being said, it's my turn!

226
00:18:58,024 --> 00:19:05,524
ベジマイトパワーで驚異のタイムを見せられるか！
Can Vegemite power deliver a blazing fast time!?

227
00:19:05,524 --> 00:19:10,024
ということで、ベイビーの準備ができたようです！
And with that, it seems Bae is ready!

228
00:19:10,024 --> 00:19:15,024
一番似合ってるわ！
It suits her the most!

229
00:19:15,024 --> 00:19:18,024
Just fit! Just fit!

230
00:19:18,024 --> 00:19:21,024
普段から乗ってるでしょ？
You usually ride this, don't you?

231
00:19:21,024 --> 00:19:25,024
普段乗ってねぇよ！
I don't usually ride this!

232
00:19:25,024 --> 00:19:28,524
どうですか？意気込みをお願いします！
How do you feel? Give us your enthusiasm!

233
00:19:28,524 --> 00:19:34,024
いやもう、全てはベジマイトのためである。僕は勝つ！
Well, everything is for the Vegemite. I will win!

234
00:19:34,024 --> 00:19:40,024
とんでもないよ！ベジマイト好きすぎるだろ！
Unbelievable! You love Vegemite way too much!

235
00:19:40,024 --> 00:19:44,024
ベジマイトから生まれたんじゃない？
Weren't you born from Vegemite?

236
00:19:44,024 --> 00:19:47,024
だからBae？
Is that why you're Bae?

237
00:19:47,024 --> 00:19:50,024
だからBaeですよ！
That's why I'm Bae!

238
00:19:50,024 --> 00:19:54,024
どうせ勝つだし、大丈夫！
I'm gonna win anyway, so it's fine!

239
00:19:54,024 --> 00:20:00,024
そんなこと言ったらさ、トワが... あ、すみません...
If you say that, Towa will... Ah, sorry...

240
00:20:02,032 --> 00:20:03,532
Sorry, you can't cross! There's an accident!

241
00:20:03,532 --> 00:20:06,032
There's an accident! You have to go around.

242
00:20:06,032 --> 00:20:09,532
Sorry, you can't cross here. Sorry, go home!

243
00:20:09,532 --> 00:20:12,532
Go home! Go home!

244
00:20:16,032 --> 00:20:19,532
ということで、じゃあ。これで順位決まりますから、我々...
So, with this, the ranking will be decided...

245
00:20:19,532 --> 00:20:23,832
ベジマイトとどうなるかというのが、これで決まりますから。
...and what happens with the Vegemite will be decided by this.

246
00:20:23,832 --> 00:20:26,032
位置についていいですか？ - はい！
Are you ready at the starting line? - Yes!

247
00:20:26,032 --> 00:20:28,032
Here we go!

248
00:20:28,032 --> 00:20:29,832
Go!

249
00:20:30,032 --> 00:20:33,532
2, 1... Go!

250
00:20:33,532 --> 00:20:37,032
うわ、なんか...あ、ヤバい！ヤバい！なんかマジで必死...
Whoa, she's trying so hard!

251
00:20:37,032 --> 00:20:40,832
ヤバい、ガチの顔してる！シリアス面！シリアス面！
Look at her super serious face! Look at that serious face!

252
00:20:41,032 --> 00:20:43,032
ちょっと！ヤバい！
Wait, this is crazy!

253
00:20:47,032 --> 00:20:50,532
速い...！ちょっと...
She's so fast! Wait...

254
00:20:50,532 --> 00:20:54,032
Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait!

255
00:20:54,032 --> 00:20:57,032
Wait! Wait!

256
00:20:57,032 --> 00:20:59,832
Wait! - ねぇー！
Wait! - Hey!

257
00:20:59,832 --> 00:21:02,532
イェーイ！
Yay!

258
00:21:02,832 --> 00:21:06,032
速い...速いぞ、ベイビー。
Fast... That was so fast, baby!

259
00:21:06,032 --> 00:21:08,532
速すぎた、私。
I was way too fast.

260
00:21:08,532 --> 00:21:11,232
速すぎるだろ！
Isn't that way too fast?!

261
00:21:11,232 --> 00:21:13,532
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

262
00:21:16,032 --> 00:21:18,032
じゃあ、発表行きますか！
Alright, shall we go to the results announcement?

263
00:21:18,032 --> 00:21:21,032
はい！はい！
Yes! Yes!

264
00:21:21,032 --> 00:21:24,532
さっきの順番でどこを食べるか...
Based on our order earlier, who eats what...

265
00:21:24,532 --> 00:21:27,032
僕のタイム、お願いします！
Show my time, please!

266
00:21:27,032 --> 00:21:30,032
おお〜！
Whoa!

267
00:21:30,032 --> 00:21:33,532
全員、ベジマイト食べます！
Everyone is eating Vegemite!

268
00:21:37,532 --> 00:21:40,032
She's excited about that.
She's so excited about that!

269
00:21:40,032 --> 00:21:43,032
お調子者すぎる、マジで！
She's getting way too carried away, seriously!

270
00:21:43,032 --> 00:21:45,032
She's so hyped about that.

271
00:21:45,032 --> 00:21:48,832
We gonna prepare the... Not a punishment, it's a prize!
We're gonna prepare... It's not a punishment, it's a prize!

272
00:21:48,832 --> 00:21:53,832
みんなも心の中で優勝なんで。これはプレゼントです！
In everyone's hearts, you're all winners. So this is a present!

273
00:21:53,832 --> 00:21:58,532
なんか言ってる！イイように言ってるだけだよ！
She's just trying to frame it nicely!

274
00:21:58,532 --> 00:22:03,532
なのでみんな、ちょっと待ってね！ We gonna get the place prepared...
So everyone, please wait a bit! We gonna get the place prepared...

275
00:22:03,532 --> 00:22:07,532
...to taste some Vegemite!

276
00:22:09,532 --> 00:22:13,532
ベジマイト食べます！
We're eating Vegemite!

277
00:22:14,032 --> 00:22:16,032
Woah!

278
00:22:16,032 --> 00:22:18,032
The dishes are ready.

279
00:22:18,032 --> 00:22:21,032
You know, when I first had these four enter...

280
00:22:21,032 --> 00:22:24,532
...I knew from the get go, they were lacking nutrition.
...I knew from the get-go, they were lacking nutrition.

281
00:22:24,532 --> 00:22:28,832
やっぱりね、この4人が入った瞬間に、もう分かってました。
As expected, the moment these four walked in, I already knew.

282
00:22:28,832 --> 00:22:30,532
What are you talking about?

283
00:22:30,532 --> 00:22:35,032
栄養が足りてない。栄養が足りてない！
Lacking nutrition. You're lacking nutrition!

284
00:22:35,032 --> 00:22:39,032
なので、こちらを準備しております。
So, I have prepared this for you all.

285
00:22:39,032 --> 00:22:44,032
You know, everyone is lacking nutrition. And what is the most important meal of the day?

286
00:22:44,032 --> 00:22:46,832
That's right, breakfast!

287
00:22:46,832 --> 00:22:51,032
朝ご飯が一番大事な食事なんで、今日は皆様に栄養たっぷり...
Breakfast is the most important meal, so today I've prepared...

288
00:22:51,032 --> 00:22:56,832
...朝ご飯を用意しております。
...a nutrition-packed breakfast for you.

289
00:22:59,032 --> 00:23:03,032
A very delicious dish! Very delicious!

290
00:23:03,032 --> 00:23:07,032
Very delicious? - Very delicious dish.
Very delicious? - A very delicious dish.

291
00:23:07,032 --> 00:23:14,032
You can take off... - お〜！
You can take off... - Ooh!

292
00:23:14,032 --> 00:23:17,032
ちょっと1つずつご紹介させてください。
Let me introduce them one by one.

293
00:23:17,032 --> 00:23:20,532
まずはですね、生ベジマイトありますね。
First off, we have plain Vegemite here.

294
00:23:20,532 --> 00:23:24,532
えっと、これは後でね、トワ様と...
Umm, this is for later... Towa-sama and...

295
00:23:24,532 --> 00:23:29,032
イナは食べたことないんで、1回ちょっとね生で...
...Ina have never had it before, so just once plain...

296
00:23:29,032 --> 00:23:33,532
...味でね、ちょっとだけ...
...just a little bit to taste it.

297
00:23:33,532 --> 00:23:36,532
で、これはもう健康的な朝ご飯を用意しております。
And here, I've prepared a healthy breakfast.

298
00:23:36,532 --> 00:23:40,532
まずはね、パン！パンにベジマイト塗っております。
First is bread! Spread with Vegemite on top.

299
00:23:40,532 --> 00:23:45,832
これはまあ、オーストラリア定番の朝ご飯です。This is a very traditional Australian breakfast...
This is a staple Australian breakfast. This is a very traditional Australian breakfast...

300
00:23:45,832 --> 00:23:48,832
...with bread and Vegemite.

301
00:23:48,832 --> 00:23:52,832
で、次に参ります。味噌汁でございます。
Moving on to the next one, we have miso soup.

302
00:23:52,832 --> 00:23:57,532
When we speak of Japanese breakfast, we think of miso soup.

303
00:23:57,532 --> 00:24:01,032
朝ご飯と言えば...まあ、本当に豪華！
And speaking of breakfast... well, a truly luxurious one!

304
00:24:01,032 --> 00:24:05,032
朝ご飯と言ったら、お寿司ですね！
Speaking of breakfast, it's sushi!

305
00:24:05,032 --> 00:24:07,532
朝から食わねぇよ、お寿司！
Nobody eats sushi in the morning!

306
00:24:07,532 --> 00:24:10,032
朝から寿司食わねぇ...
Nobody eats sushi for breakfast...

307
00:24:10,032 --> 00:24:14,032
I just need someone to agree with me that Vegemite and sushi is amazing.

308
00:24:14,032 --> 00:24:19,032
ちょっとね、認めてほしくて。寿司とベジマイト、マジで似合うんだって！
I just want you to admit it. Sushi and Vegemite actually go together so well!

309
00:24:19,032 --> 00:24:22,032
嘘だ！どこにつけたの、ベジマイト？
No way! Where did you put the Vegemite?

310
00:24:22,032 --> 00:24:26,532
ワサビみたいに、ちょっと裏に...
Like wasabi, just a little underneath...

311
00:24:26,532 --> 00:24:31,032
嘘だ！ワサビじゃない！ - ワサビの代わりに...
Liar! That's not wasabi! - Instead of wasabi...

312
00:24:31,032 --> 00:24:36,832
なんかこれオープンした瞬間から、なん科学...大丈夫？
The moment this opened, I felt like sneezing... Are you okay?

313
00:24:36,832 --> 00:24:42,032
なので、ちょっとトワ様とイナはベジマイト初なんで、ちょっと生で...
So since it's Towa-sama and Ina's first time with Vegemite, just a bit plain...

314
00:24:42,032 --> 00:24:48,032
Or like, you'll get rid of the taste of any other food after.

315
00:24:48,032 --> 00:24:51,032
No, no, no! Just a little bit. Have a little courage.

316
00:24:51,032 --> 00:24:53,032
いただきます。
Bon appétit.

317
00:24:53,032 --> 00:24:58,032
Try it! Try it! Okay, Towa-sama first. Oh, she's going for it!

318
00:25:00,840 --> 00:25:01,840
ん？普通？
Huh? Normal?

319
00:25:03,940 --> 00:25:05,540
え？めっちゃいい顔した！
Eh? You made such a face!

320
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:08,240
まあ、いけなくはない。
Well, it's not impossible to eat.

321
00:25:08,540 --> 00:25:11,840
いい顔！ちょっとスゴいな...
Nice face! That's pretty impressive...

322
00:25:12,040 --> 00:25:15,840
「いけなくはない」なるほどですね。はい、OKです。じゃあ次！
"Not impossible," I see. Alright, cool. Next!

323
00:25:16,840 --> 00:25:18,540
Let's go!

324
00:25:19,540 --> 00:25:21,240
Don't be scary! 恐れるな！
Don't be scared! Don't be scared!

325
00:25:21,540 --> 00:25:24,040
Don't be scary, don't be scary. It's good! It tastes so good!

326
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:26,540
Okay, 味噌、味噌...
Okay, miso, miso...

327
00:25:28,040 --> 00:25:29,840
行きます。平気だよ！
Here I go. I'll be fine!

328
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:33,540
行きます。
Here I go.

329
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:45,840
It's not that bad. / See! あー、さすが！
It's not that bad. / See! Ah, as expected!

330
00:25:46,040 --> 00:25:50,540
Not that bad. Pretty good. Not that bad equals pretty good.

331
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:52,540
美味しいでしょ？
Delicious, right?

332
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:54,040
うん、悪くない。
Yeah, not bad.

333
00:25:54,140 --> 00:25:55,340
悪くない！いける！
Not bad! It works!

334
00:25:55,540 --> 00:25:57,040
Would you choose to eat it?

335
00:25:57,140 --> 00:26:04,040
If I had absolutely no other side dishes, and only a bowl of rice... possibly.

336
00:26:05,540 --> 00:26:08,540
じゃあちょっと、みんなの朝ごはんタイム行きますか！
Alright then, shall we move on to everyone's breakfast time?

337
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:10,840
じゃあ最初パンでおねがいします。
Let me start with bread, please.

338
00:26:11,040 --> 00:26:12,840
パンで。 / はい。
With bread. / Yes.

339
00:26:13,040 --> 00:26:15,040
いただきます。
Bon appétit.

340
00:26:16,540 --> 00:26:18,540
See, it's good with bread. / See! 美味しいでしょ！
See, it's good with bread. / See! Tasty, right?

341
00:26:18,840 --> 00:26:21,040
美味しいですよねー！
It's delicious, right?

342
00:26:21,540 --> 00:26:23,840
