or people grow tired of me,

961
01:10:07,994 --> 01:10:13,994
それでも笑っていたい アイドルだから
I still want to smile, because I'm an idol.

962
01:10:13,994 --> 01:10:16,994
熱いファンの愛があって
With the passionate love of the fans,

963
01:10:16,994 --> 01:10:19,994
スタッフさんの愛があって
with the love of the staff,

964
01:10:19,994 --> 01:10:23,094
いつも家族の愛があって
and with the constant love of my family,

965
01:10:23,094 --> 01:10:24,594
