I'm living...

966
01:10:24,594 --> 01:10:25,994
アイドル
...as an idol!

967
01:10:25,994 --> 01:10:27,894
バカにする奴は嫌いだ
I hate those who make fun of me,

968
01:10:27,894 --> 01:10:30,994
見下されるのも嫌いだ
and I hate being looked down upon.

969
01:10:30,994 --> 01:10:33,994
“アイドルなんか”という言葉を
Don't say words like "just an idol"...

970
01:10:33,994 --> 01:10:36,994
見てもないくせに言うな
...when you haven't even seen what I do!

971
01:10:36,994 --> 01:10:39,894
頑張りを当然と言うな
Don't take my effort for granted,

972
01:10:39,894 --> 01:10:42,894
