Don't forget to check out YouTube Music Weekend right after this,

979
01:11:07,594 --> 01:11:10,694
and also give a lot of love to I FOUND ME and ME!

980
01:11:10,694 --> 01:11:12,394
この後もみんな見てね！
Make sure to watch what comes next, everyone!

981
01:11:12,394 --> 01:11:16,594
これからも頑張るから応援よろしくお願いします！
I'll keep doing my best from now on, so please keep supporting me!

982
01:11:16,594 --> 01:11:18,194
